{"id": "97110115", "name": "אינטגרל מסוים בחלקים – x·e^(kx), x·cos(kx), x·sin(kx) או x·ln x", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I=\\int_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} } {{CT:2}}\\,dx \\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(I=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">רשמו ערך מדויק. את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e\\)</span> מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(1)</code>, ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">pi</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מוצאים פונקציה קדומה באינטגרציה בחלקים, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int u\\,v'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'\\,v\\,dx\\)</span>, ומציבים את הגבולות לפי ניוטון–לייבניץ.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פונקציה קדומה</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:10}}\"]]מוציאים את המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> ובוחרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=x\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'={{CT:4}}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u'=1\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v={{CT:5}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int x\\,{{CT:4}}\\,dx=x\\cdot\\left({{CT:5}}\\right)-\\int\\left({{CT:5}}\\right)dx={{CT:6}} \\]</p>[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:11}}\"]]מוציאים את המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> ובוחרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=\\ln x\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v'=x\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u'=\\frac{1}{x}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int x\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\ln x-\\int\\frac{x}{2}\\,dx={{CT:6}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הצבת הגבולות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I={{CT:3}}\\left[{{CT:6}}\\right]_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:3}}\\left(\\left({{CT:7}}\\right)-\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)\\right)={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "int,integrate,diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "diff(ans1,x)", "tans": "p", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">זו פונקציה קדומה, אבל זה אינטגרל מסוים: צריך להציב את הגבולות ולחשב את ההפרש.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בדקו את הסימן בנוסחה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int u\\,v'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'\\,v\\,dx\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קיבלתם את הנגדי של התשובה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left[F\\right]_a^b=F(b)-F(a)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["B4", "F0", "Fhi0", "Flo0", "G0", "V1", "V2", "W", "af", "g", "hi", "kc", "ke", "kind", "lo", "p", "ta", "up", "w2"], "nvariants": 50}